{"id":"dbee0f67d1223ea0","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal-notation.md","title":"序数记号的忠实赋值","display":"df-ordinal-notation — 序数记号的忠实赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal-notation","aliases":["18-df-ordinal-notation","18-df-030"],"display":"df-ordinal-notation — 序数记号的忠实赋值","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal-notation</span><span>18-df-030</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-notation — 序数记号的忠实赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、值为序数的集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a> 的元语言类缩写。</p>\n<p>本节引入三元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(v)=T\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,\\bigl(s\\prec t\\leftrightarrow v(s)&lt;v(t)\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,(v(s)=v(t)\\to s=t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(v)=T\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,\\bigl(s\\prec t\\leftrightarrow v(s)&lt;v(t)\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,(v(s)=v(t)\\to s=t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地支撑定义。加入赋值单射条件，排除不同代码被压成同一序数而仍被误称为严格记号序。有效性要求另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"626b9ea69e281e07\" href=\"?note=626b9ea69e281e07\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation</a>；这里只定义忠实序嵌入，不从一个赋值函数自动推出代码集和比较关系可计算。原书 §3.3.1 和 §3.4.3 提供具体记号系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\prec\\subseteq T^2$，$v$ 是定义域为 $T$、值为序数的集合函数；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的元语言类缩写。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"626b9ea69e281e07","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本地支撑定义。加入赋值单射条件，排除不同代码被压成同一序数而仍被误称为严格记号序。有效性要求另见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation]]；这里只定义忠实序嵌入，不从一个赋值函数自动推出代码集和比较关系可计算。原书 §3.3.1 和 §3.4.3 提供具体记号系统。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(v)=T\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,\\bigl(s\\prec t\\leftrightarrow v(s)<v(t)\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\,(v(s)=v(t)\\to s=t).","display":true}],"bytes":1269,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-ordinal-notation]]"},{"id":"626b9ea69e281e07","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\omega$，$\\prec\\subseteq T^2$，$v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-notation]]。$\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k$ 是 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]] 的 $k$ 元原始递归函数族；关系 $T,\\prec$ 的全域特征函数 $\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}$ 由下式定义；$\\operatorname{Lift}_1$ 取同一函数项节点的显式输入转换。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-notation]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-notation|18-df-ordinal-notation]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-notation|18-df-ordinal-notation]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","626b9ea69e281e07"]}